2026-10-13T02:42:01.7682908Z Text-to-Layout CLI
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7683119Z 
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7683262Z positional arguments:
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7684953Z   {design,prompt,generate,verify,epr,evidence,doctor,jobs,serve,simulate,yield,chip,pdk,measurement,kqcircuits-cpw,quantum-metal-mask,pyepr-circuit,circuitq-lc,sqcircuit-lc}
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7686878Z     design              Choose and build a device from a typed electrical
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7687457Z                         goal.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7687952Z     prompt              Natural-language request -> intent, layout,
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7688550Z                         verification, simulation, report.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7689161Z     generate            Generate verified artifacts from a DSL file.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7689787Z     verify              Verify a DSL file (no export).
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7690679Z     epr                 Loss-participation (EPR) and coherence estimate for a
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7691388Z                         DSL file. EPR_ANALYTICAL_ONLY by default; never a
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7691932Z                         field solution.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7692509Z     evidence            Inspect and validate evidence ledgers (the source of
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7693144Z                         truth for every physics claim).
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7693773Z     doctor              Check the environment (imports, solvers, write perms).
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7694515Z     jobs                Start, inspect, collect, cancel, and resume persistent
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7695111Z                         local solver jobs.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7695583Z     serve               Run the FastAPI plugin server.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7696177Z     simulate            Run supported external solver benchmarks.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7696864Z     yield               JJ critical-current variability / fabrication-yield
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7697568Z                         Monte Carlo. Drawing one SQUID loop proves geometry,
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7698150Z                         not manufacturability.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7698751Z     chip                Multi-qubit chip-level frequency-collision analysis. A
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7699448Z                         single-device closed loop cannot answer whether a
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7700009Z                         processor works.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7700874Z     pdk                 Foundry PDK abstraction: list registered technologies
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7701543Z                         or inspect a PDK's full provenance and process
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7702072Z                         parameters.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7702687Z     measurement         Simulation-vs-measurement correlation: the path from
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7703389Z                         illustrative to fab-calibrated numbers.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7704074Z     kqcircuits-cpw      Generate verified straight CPW gap masks via an
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7704786Z                         isolated KQCircuits runtime; no EM simulation.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7707581Z     quantum-metal-mask  Generate independently checked charge-pad/ground
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7708357Z                         masks; no junction or EM simulation.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7708955Z     pyepr-circuit       Run an ideal one-mode circuit with
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7709588Z                         convergence/reference checks; no EM extraction.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7710304Z     circuitq-lc         Run ideal LC with fixed grid/domain/reference checks;
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7711223Z                         no EM extraction.
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7711826Z     sqcircuit-lc        Run specified ideal LC with fixed eigenpair/reference
2026-10-13T02:42:01.7712480Z                         checks; no EM extraction.
